sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: FoodWarden physical connections and heartbeat
    accDescr: Device traffic on BLE and the home LAN, followed by the gateway's authenticated connection to Firebase.
    participant F as F0 · Fridge sensor
    participant C as C0 · Camera gateway
    participant R as Home router / LAN
    participant D as D0 · Door closer
    participant S as S · Firebase API

    rect rgb(233, 243, 255)
        Note over F,C: Direct BLE GATT. Fridge sensor has no Wi-Fi.
        C->>F: Set clock over GATT
        F-->>C: AES-128-GCM telemetry with authenticated metadata
    end

    rect rgb(233, 247, 238)
        Note over C,D: The local Mosquitto broker runs on C. D validates its TLS certificate.
        C->>R: MQTT over TLS 8883 · CLOSE_DOOR or ABORT
        R->>D: Forward command on local LAN
        D-->>R: Publish status, acknowledgement and safety events
        R-->>C: Broker receives D status and updates last contact
        Note over C,D: Door safety works on the local network if the internet fails.
    end

    rect rgb(250, 241, 224)
        Note over C,S: HTTPS with gateway Bearer token.
        C->>R: Send or retry buffered telemetry
        R->>S: POST /api/telemetry
        S-->>C: Return ingested count
        C->>R: Heartbeat every 60 s per PR #5
        R->>S: POST /api/status · C0, F0, D0 and last seen values
        S-->>C: Return updated count
        Note over C,S: Gateway sender still needs the PR #5 integration.
    end
